{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "9001e41cacbd5c7c00bdc65ed42b1396e7bca468b75cadbbbda601382dc93a61", "ja": "だんごより？", "zh": "比起团子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0ab861b67bd4d95d8f3ecc1f6d2c30d5a1c44d5c552ae5edf99d32468977c8b5", "ja": "一通りお花見会場を回って、大満足な様子の\nのり子達。次はどこに行こうかと考えている\nと、不意に突風が吹き、桜吹雪に包まれる。\nその美しさに目を奪われたのり子は、しばし\n休憩にし、桜を眺めることを提案する。", "zh": "把赏樱会场逛了一圈后，のり子她们看起来十分满足。正想着接下来要去哪里时，突然刮起一阵强风，众人被卷入樱花飞舞之中。被这美景吸引住目光的のり子提议，暂时休息一会儿，欣赏樱花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9c126db33feac49cb65b3708b9fded13f7c379c732da0e6f2789371586aadcba", "ja": "（あそこにいるのは……のり子と昴と真か。\nみんなもイベントを楽しんでるみたいだな）", "zh": "（在那里的是……のり子、昴和真吧。看来大家也都在享受活动呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "dc7042bf111e688789ca3514e60278d11043670a6a6e5285359b607fb8f50530", "ja": "我ら！　お花見を満喫したい三銃士！\n大満足の帰還♪", "zh": "我们！是想尽情享受赏花的三剑客！\n心满意足地凯旋归来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7d97525f7e549033c664c867fbc669b5ea98d3ec786237730b8d154aa4f1c3a6", "ja": "（三銃士の顔ぶれが変わってるな……）", "zh": "（三剑客的成员换了啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "4799af95962ab60f08fa39ce744e5f585a57b87aedd23373b8fa3f7bad3d695b", "ja": "お花見って楽しいな～！　オレ、ピンク色のおにぎりと\n花の形のだし巻きと、桜餅食べたんだ～！", "zh": "赏花真开心啊～！我吃了粉红色的饭团、花朵形状的高汤玉子烧，还有樱饼哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "09439ee1374a730d6343cb3feae773704125417abdf639d2168cf34cb8d1f7ce", "ja": "ボクは、的あてゲームにハマっちゃって。ボールで\n全部のパネルを抜くの、すっごく難しかったよ。", "zh": "我迷上了投球打靶游戏。用球把所有靶板都打下来，真的特别难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "980ecefc008f67523d338d45e9e86d02fdef20a112098e992cd7a551c5054555", "ja": "次はどこ行く？　たくさん遊んでお腹が\n減ってきちゃったから、また屋台に……わっ！", "zh": "接下来去哪儿？玩了这么久，肚子都开始饿了，我们再去小摊……哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1006_null", "source_sha256": "f10b96b4a96546c2eee153ef9ddfeb7c7a5a0b76565402996564ce5ef8e34108", "ja": "ビューーー！", "zh": "冲呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "8e76f75e1d76d27f2e0065d0372772014fd76c365d4402c26192cddfc1a6fbe4", "ja": "うわあっ、すげえ風……！　もしかして、\n春一番ってやつ？　あれ？　それはもう終わった？", "zh": "哇啊，风好大……！难不成，\n这就是春一番？咦？那个已经过去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "730017670b6182e35c791064ad908f47136beca27aefb21dae6f473b78e90467", "ja": "ふたりとも、大丈夫！？　せっかく綺麗に咲いたのに、\nこんなに強い風が吹いたら……。", "zh": "你们两个都没事吧！？好不容易开得这么漂亮，要是刮这么大的风……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "93a03e3f5a88d0c93a08504fd406db500ab9d299e8897c92474d2212c03e3a44", "ja": "……うわぁ～っ！\n桜の花びらが一面に舞って……すごくキレイだなぁ。", "zh": "……哇啊～！\n漫天都是飞舞的樱花瓣……真漂亮啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "a6bfcf3c6f62e3ca61985b2ff63236224617bacf8ee6e9bb3ee59f66469aae05", "ja": "うんうん、すっげーキレイ！　オレ知ってるぜ。\nこういうの、桜吹雪っていうんだよな！", "zh": "嗯嗯，超级漂亮！我知道这个哦。\n这种情况，就叫做落樱如雪吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "ea41ea4c3b8eb5a0eb507cfd32f73d37147f28cc8a790f6c483e559169e86ef4", "ja": "……ねえ、ふたりとも。しばらく、桜を見てかない？\nほら、アタシたちずーっと歩き回ってたし……。", "zh": "……我说，你们两个。要不要看一会儿樱花再走？\n你看，我们一直走来走去的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "8f812387ec55cc7df29ed7ff43175cbcf72e2d6f137ec861972dfb8767db8460", "ja": "この後ライブもあるし、ちょっと休憩してさ。\n桜を見ながら、まったり話でもしようよ！", "zh": "接下来还有演出，先稍微休息一下吧。\n我们一边赏樱，一边悠闲地聊聊天吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8ce47c1c80d247b1a1ae6512ccc1967fdd01ab4491a8d8361e3085c5ccc16ecb", "ja": "（桜を見ながらお喋りだなんて、風流だな。\nみんなに飲み物でも持っていってやるか……）", "zh": "（一边赏樱一边聊天，真是风雅啊。要不要拿些饮料给大家……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
